WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.958
YAML locale files
map keys to strings,

2
00:00:03.958 --> 00:00:07.615
and an unquoted colon or a
leading percent sign breaks the

3
00:00:07.615 --> 00:00:08.160
file.

4
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:12.969
General Translation's CLI
translates YAML values in place and

5
00:00:12.969 --> 00:00:14.268
leaves keys alone.

6
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:19.538
Quote values that contain a colon
or start with a placeholder.

7
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.898
Add a yaml entry to gt.config.json
with a locale pattern.

8
00:00:25.298 --> 00:00:29.629
Then npx gt translate writes
the German file from the English

9
00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:30.022
one.

10
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.042
Load the files the
way your app does,

11
00:00:33.042 --> 00:00:35.560
and add any plural keys
the language needs.

12
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.680
Your team now ships
German with each release.
